# Traefik — configuration
# Not copied anywhere. This documents the plaintext contents of traefik/enc.env,
# which is committed age-encrypted and edited in place:
#
#   sops traefik/enc.env       decrypts into $EDITOR, re-encrypts on save
#
# There is no traefik/.env. `./runit.sh` decrypts enc.env straight into its own
# environment and execs `docker compose` there, so every value below reaches the
# container through `${VAR}` interpolation in compose.yml — and only if it is
# named there. Adding a variable here and to enc.env is not enough on its own.
#

# Cloudflare API token used for the ACME DNS-01 challenge.
# Create at: https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
# Required permissions: Zone / DNS / Edit  +  Zone / Zone / Read
# scoped to the zone that hosts the *.ham51.com records.
CF_DNS_API_TOKEN=cloudflare-dns-api-token-here
